"Rengar Master Yi Reroll TFT Comp, Patch 18.4b | PivotTFT (https://www.pivottft.com/comps/rengar-master-yi-reroll/)\nciteturn22view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.pivottft.com/comps/rengar-master-yi-reroll/\",\"pattern\":\"Many games add\"}); Total lines: 191\nL0: cite0†Skip to content L1: \nL2: cite1†PivotTFT L3: \nL4: Tier Lists\nL5: \nL6: cite2†Comps66 cite3†Items136 cite4†Augments246 L7: \nL8: cite5†Patches cite6†Guides cite7†Set 18 Info cite8†Builder L9: \nL10: cite2†Comp tier list L11: \nL12: A\nL13: # Rengar Master Yi Reroll TFT Set 18 comp guide\nL14: \nL15: A tier Reroll Medium Level 7 Patch 18.4b\nL16: \nL17: By PivotTFT · Updated 11 October 2026\nL18: \nL19: Rengar and Master Yi at three stars carry together behind Vi and Sett; Blossom 3, Adaptor and Primal round out a board built from 3-costs.\nL20: cite9†Image: Rengar cite10†Image: Edge of Night cite11†Image: Guinsoo's Rageblade cite12†Image: Titan's Resolve Rengar cite13†Image: Master Yi cite10†Image: Edge of Night cite14†Image: Kraken's Fury cite15†Image: Quicksilver Master Yi cite16†Image: Sett Sett cite17†Image: Vi cite18†Image: Evenshroud cite19†Image: Sunfire Cape cite20†Image: Warmog's Armor Vi cite21†Image: Krug Krug\nL21: \nL22: cite22†Image: Yorick Yorick\nL23: \nL24: cite23†Image: Nidalee Nidalee\nL25: \nL26: Final board. Front line at the top.\nL27: \nL28: Copy link [Button: Copy team code] cite24†Open in builder L29: ## Overview\nL30: \nL31: Commit when Rengar and Master Yi copies both come early: it needs both at three stars, so one missing leaves the board short. Master Yi Reroll, Tristana Rengar Reroll and Vanguard Rengar Reroll buy the same copies, so check the lobby at 3-2. Both carries start with Edge of Night, which makes a B.F. Sword and a Chain Vest the first components to keep.\nL32: ## Units and items\nL33: \nL34:   * cite25†Image: Rengar cite26†Rengar Carry\nL35:   * cite27†Image: Master Yi cite28†Master Yi Carry\nL36:   * cite29†Image: Sett cite30†Sett No items needed\nL37:   * cite31†Image: Nidalee cite32†Nidalee No items needed\nL38:   * cite33†Image: Vi cite34†Vi L39:   * cite35†Image: Krug cite36†Krug No items needed\nL40:   * cite37†Image: Yorick cite38†Yorick No items needed\nL41: Rengar carries with Edge of Night, Guinsoo's Rageblade and Titan's Resolve. Master Yi carries with Edge of Night, Kraken's Fury and Quicksilver. Vi takes Evenshroud, Sunfire Cape and Warmog's Armor.\nL42: ### Item order\nL43: \nL44:   1. cite10†Image: Edge of Night Edge of Night\nL45:   2. cite11†Image: Guinsoo's Rageblade Guinsoo's Rageblade\nL46:   3. cite12†Image: Titan's Resolve Titan's Resolve\nL47:   4. cite15†Image: Quicksilver Quicksilver\nL48:   5. cite19†Image: Sunfire Cape Sunfire Cape\nL49: \nL50: ## How to play Rengar Master Yi Reroll\nL51: ### Early game\nL52: \nL53: Brawler and Blossom pairs (Rek'Sai, Kobuko, Yorick) save health; hold every Rengar and Master Yi you see.\nL54: \nL55:   * cite39†Image: Rek'Sai Rek'Sai\nL56:   * cite40†Image: Kobuko Kobuko\nL57:   * cite37†Image: Yorick Yorick\nL58:   * cite41†Image: Akali Akali\nL59: \nL60: ### Mid game\nL61: \nL62: Level 7 around 3-5 and slow roll above 50 gold for Rengar, Master Yi and Vi at three stars.\nL63: ### Late game\nL64: \nL65: Level 8 for Kog'Maw and Adaptor 3, then upgrade Sett.\nL66: \nL67: TipRengar takes Edge of Night, Guinsoo's and Titan's; Master Yi Edge of Night, Kraken's Fury and Quicksilver. Many games add a Brawler Emblem to one of them. It contests Master Yi with the Adaptor reroll, so scout first.\nL68: ## Best augments\nL69: \nL70:   * cite42†Image: Rolling For Days cite43†Rolling For Days Silver, S tier on our list Gain 10 free Shop rerolls.\nL71:   * cite44†Image: Latent Forge cite45†Latent Forge Silver, S tier on our list After 8 player combats, gain an Artifact anvil.\nL72:   * cite46†Image: Swordsmith cite47†Swordsmith Gold, A tier on our list Gain 2 random completed items that build from B.F. Sword.\nL73:   * cite48†Image: Item Grab Bag I cite49†Item Grab Bag I Silver, A tier on our list Gain 1 random completed item.\nL74: Augment priority: econ, then items.\nL75: ## Traits\nL76: \nL77: cite50†Image: Blossom Blossom 3cite51†Image: Adaptor Adaptor 2cite52†Image: Primal Primal 2cite53†Image: Brawler Brawler 2\nL78: \nL79: Active on the final board: 3 Blossom, 2 Adaptor, 2 Primal, 2 Brawler, 2 Juggernaut and 1 Rival. Every trait is explained in the cite54†Set 18 traits guide .\nL80: \nL81: ## Late upgrades\nL82: \nL83:   * cite55†Image: Kog'Maw Kog'Maw added\nL84: \nL85: ## Questions about Rengar Master Yi Reroll\nL86: ### Is Rengar Master Yi Reroll good in patch 18.4b?\nL87: \nL88: Rengar Master Yi Reroll is A tier on the PivotTFT comp tier list for patch 18.4b: a strong comp this patch and often the right call when your early units or items point to it.\nL89: \nL90: ### Who is the carry in Rengar Master Yi Reroll?\nL91: \nL92: Rengar is the main carry. Build Edge of Night, Guinsoo's Rageblade and Titan's Resolve on Rengar.\nL93: ### What level do you play Rengar Master Yi Reroll at?\nL94: \nL95: Rengar Master Yi Reroll is a Reroll comp: you stay at a low level and spend gold rolling for three-star copies of cheaper champions. Roll for the board at level 7.\nL96: \nL97: ### How do I import Rengar Master Yi Reroll into TFT?\nL98: \nL99: Copy its team code with the button on this page, then open the Team Planner in the TFT client and paste it.\nL100: ### What are the best augments for Rengar Master Yi Reroll?\nL101: \nL102: Rolling For Days, Latent Forge, Swordsmith and Item Grab Bag I. When none of these is offered, take econ, then items augments.\nL103: \nL104: ## Similar comps\nL105: \nL106:   * cite56†SNidalee Aphelios L107:   * cite57†SRiftbeast Reroll L108:   *